                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/1429: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Harbin</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Jenkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-17T09:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17,
                                1920—9 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:23 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Strike will be declared ended 11 o’clock to-day. Horvat has resigned.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jenkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
